    <agentDescription>This agent proactively identifies Renewal Opportunities that require attention and prioritization. It analyzes open Renewal Opportunities using factors such as contract expiration dates, customer engagement history, CSAT scores, support case activity, and overall account health signals to assess renewal risk.
Based on this analysis, the agent determines the likelihood of churn or delayed renewal and recommends appropriate next actions. It generates personalized renewal outreach email drafts tailored to the customer&apos;s situation, suggests engagement strategies, and automatically creates follow-up tasks for Opportunity owners to ensure timely action.
The objective of the agent is to improve renewal outcomes, increase customer retention, and reduce churn risk through proactive and intelligent intervention.</agentDescription>
